# Nested scene instances

Parent stores the instance root + property overrides only. Do not `owner` or serialize descendants that belong to the nested scene; edit the source instead. Parent-only nodes go on a wrapper/sibling. After save, reopen — any `incoming node's name clashes` = failed change.
